  "adv.globalHelp": "<div style='font-weight:600;color:var(--text-main);margin-bottom:4px;'>With “Global property editing” enabled, the following changes sync to every frame of this object:</div>· <b>Color / line width</b><br>· <b>Head hollow/filled, custom fill color</b><br>· <b>Body proportions</b> (head, arms, legs, torso, forearm ratio, shin ratio)<br>· <b>Independent limbs</b> (left/right arm length, leg length, forearm, shin)<br>· <b>Side highlight</b> (on/off, color, width, angle)<br>· <b>Outline glow</b> (on/off, color, opacity, radius)<br>· <b>Hand gradient</b> (on/off, color, start position)<br>· <b>Rear-limb darkening</b> (on/off, custom color)<br>· <b>Ground shadow stretch</b> (width, height)<br>· <b>Joint pinning IK</b> (left foot/right foot/torso/left hand/right hand) — pin/unpin across all frames<br>· <b>Position moves</b> (drag torso, move handle, type coordinates) — apply the same offset to all frames<div style='margin-top:6px;color:var(--color-danger);'><i data-icon='caution'></i> To be updated</div>",
